# WHAT MUST NOT LEAVE THIS MACHINE.
#
# The deploy uploads the working directory, and this directory holds two
# workbooks that are licensed for internal use, not for redistribution, and
# that carry personal data -- a named last modifier, cell comments by a named
# employee, and a sheet of partners and client contacts. .gitignore keeps them
# out of the repository; this keeps them out of a build artifact.
reference/
*.xlsx
*.xlsb
*.xlsm

# Committed periods. Real company data, and useless to a server that reads
# Postgres.
*.db
*.db-journal
*.sqlite

# Secrets belong in the platform's own store, never in an upload.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

.next/
node_modules/
.git/
